 "sfx": [],
 "caps": [
  {
   "text": "A coworker texts you.",
   "start": 0.82,
   "end": 2.47,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Honest question.",
   "start": 2.78,
   "end": 3.51,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is good,",
   "start": 3.86,
   "end": 4.99,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "why does my sister have cancer?",
   "start": 5.1,
   "end": 6.83,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "What do you type back?",
   "start": 7.34,
   "end": 8.45,
   "line": "L2"
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of us freeze.",
   "start": 11.04,
   "end": 12.39,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not because we don't believe,",
   "start": 12.72,
   "end": 14.25,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "but because we've never practiced",
   "start": 14.58,
   "end": 15.73,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "saying it out loud,",
   "start": 15.76,
   "end": 16.71,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "to someone who pushes back.",
   "start": 16.74,
   "end": 18.75,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "So we built Apologist Academy.",
   "start": 32.64,
   "end": 34.95,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "A safe place to practice",
   "start": 35.14,
   "end": 36.41,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "the hard questions,",
   "start": 36.44,
   "end": 37.75,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "before someone asks you for real.",
   "start": 37.78,
   "end": 39.47,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pick one of sixteen questions",
   "start": 39.74,
   "end": 41.07,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "across eight topics,",
   "start": 41.1,
   "end": 42.59,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "from suffering to science",
   "start": 42.7,
   "end": 44.21,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "to other faiths.",
   "start": 44.24,
   "end": 45.11,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "No account.",
   "start": 45.4,
   "end": 46.23,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing to install.",
   "start": 46.32,
   "end": 47.43,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then choose who you're talking to.",
   "start": 47.86,
   "end": 49.87,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Curious asks honest questions.",
   "start": 50.28,
   "end": 52.25,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hostile pushes hard,",
   "start": 52.64,
   "end": 53.95,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "but stays civil.",
   "start": 53.98,
   "end": 55.07,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "And you set how hard it pushes.",
   "start": 55.28,
   "end": 57.09,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now you talk it through,",
   "start": 57.36,
   "end": 58.33,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "for five turns.",
   "start": 58.36,
   "end": 59.87,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "Type your reply,",
   "start": 60.02,
   "end": 60.71,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "or just speak it.",
   "start": 60.74,
   "end": 62.19,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "The skeptic isn't reading",
   "start": 62.24,
   "end": 63.43,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "from a script.",
   "start": 63.46,
   "end": 64.45,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "It answers what you actually said.",
   "start": 64.58,
   "end": 66.65,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pick a tougher skeptic,",
   "start": 66.82,
   "end": 67.93,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "and it won't let a vague answer slide.",
   "start": 67.96,
   "end": 70.11,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stuck? Ask Coach.",
   "start": 70.62,
   "end": 72.37,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "It helps in steps.",
   "start": 72.58,
   "end": 73.79,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "First a hint.",
   "start": 74,
   "end": 74.95,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then an outline.",
   "start": 75.08,
   "end": 76.33,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a sample reply,",
   "start": 76.58,
   "end": 77.87,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "only if you want it.",
   "start": 77.9,
   "end": 79.11,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "The goal is to find your own words.",
   "start": 79.16,
   "end": 81.39,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because this isn't a debate to win.",
   "start": 85.47,
   "end": 87.74,
   "line": "L13"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a person to listen to.",
   "start": 88.05,
   "end": 89.74,
   "line": "L13"
  },
  {
   "text": "After five turns,",
   "start": 90.1,
   "end": 91.49,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Coach writes you a short review.",
   "start": 91.52,
   "end": 93.15,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "What you covered,",
   "start": 93.36,
   "end": 94.17,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "what you could add,",
   "start": 94.2,
   "end": 95.19,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "and a verse to study.",
   "start": 95.22,
   "end": 96.43,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "No scores. No grades.",
   "start": 96.6,
   "end": 98.37,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Print it,",
   "start": 98.66,
   "end": 98.93,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "and bring it to your small group.",
   "start": 98.96,
   "end": 100.55,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "It doesn't replace your church.",
   "start": 100.7,
   "end": 102.35,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "It helps you get ready",
   "start": 102.52,
   "end": 103.35,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "for real conversations.",
   "start": 103.38,
   "end": 104.89,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "And it works on any screen.",
   "start": 105.26,
   "end": 107.23,
   "line": "L16"
  },
  {
   "text": "We built it carefully.",
   "start": 109.61,
   "end": 111,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "The AI is always labeled.",
   "start": 111.29,
   "end": 113.52,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "The skeptic never pretends",
   "start": 113.55,
   "end": 114.82,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "to be converted,",
   "start": 114.85,
   "end": 115.8,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "and never insults you or your faith.",
   "start": 115.83,
   "end": 118.02,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "If someone seems to be in crisis,",
   "start": 118.29,
   "end": 119.92,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "it stops the exercise",
   "start": 120.01,
   "end": 121.14,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "and points them to real help.",
   "start": 121.17,
   "end": 123.08,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "And Coach quotes one checked verse,",
   "start": 123.23,
   "end": 124.74,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "and never makes up sources.",
   "start": 124.77,
   "end": 126.58,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the hood,",
   "start": 127.35,
   "end": 128.3,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "our server sets the rules:",
   "start": 128.39,
   "end": 130.08,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "five turns,",
   "start": 130.25,
   "end": 131.12,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "separate instructions for each role,",
   "start": 131.29,
   "end": 133.02,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "and a daily limit.",
   "start": 133.05,
   "end": 134.28,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Apologist Project's AI platform",
   "start": 134.51,
   "end": 136.38,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "plays the skeptic",
   "start": 136.41,
   "end": 137.44,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "and powers Coach and the review,",
   "start": 137.47,
   "end": 139.28,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "with memory turned off.",
   "start": 139.31,
   "end": 140.74,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the next time someone asks,",
   "start": 141.61,
   "end": 143.34,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "you won't freeze.",
   "start": 143.49,
   "end": 144.56,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "You'll be ready,",
   "start": 144.81,
   "end": 145.46,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "with gentleness and respect.",
   "start": 145.49,
   "end": 147.74,
   "line": "L21"
  }
 ],
